Maps the keyboard/mouse and the first connected controller to the primary platform user. Any subsequently connected gamepads will be mapped to the next platform user without a valid input device already assigned to them.
An example of this policy when you have 3 gamepads and a keyboard/mouse connected would be something like this;
-- Platform User 0 (Primary) ---> Keyboard and mouse ---> Gamepad 0 | -- Platform User 1 ---> Gamepad 1 | -- PlatformUser 2 ---> Gamepad 2

